[h1]Mercs![/h1]

Starting from today, you may face a new enemy on the battlefield - T4 Jericho Covert Ops ships is ready for lift off!

It has a unique set of characteristics:

[b]- Brings double profit;
- Does not need repairs;
- Has two additional cargo slots;
- Accumulates 20% free synergy;
- Beacon capture speed increased by 20%;
- Critical chance increased by 30%;
- Main weapon damage increased by 10%;
- Effects of covert ops modules are increased by 20%.[/b]

Covert Ops ships are designed for sudden hit and run attacks on individual enemy ships. A special plasma web allows these ships to cause damage to the enemy without any direct contact whatsoever, while the ship's guidance system grants more critical hits. Active modules can temporarily increase damage done by the main weapons, as well as prevent the enemy from locking on your ship.

Slash your enemies into pieces with new 'Cutter'!

http://youtu.be/PC9CFFe6Tgc

