[h1]Pilots![/h1]

Meet the newest addition to our ships tree premium T4 Tackler - 'Sawtooth', Jericho warriors loved this ship for its unique appearance and flight efficiency! Now it is our pilots' turn to try it out in battle!

The ship is available for Jericho pilots and has some special features:
[list][b][*]Brings double profit;
[*]Does not need repairs;
[*]Has two additional cargo slots;
[*]Accumulates 20% free synergy;
[*]Afterburner energy draw reduced by 20%;
[*]Rotation speed increased by 25%;
[*]Critical damage increased by 20%.[/b][/list]

As our pilots know, a Tackler's objective is to find and destroy enemy Recon and Covert Ops ships. Using invisibility, tacklers can secretly move through the most dangerous zones in battle. Their high speed enables them to intercept Recon and Covert Ops ships and their Active modules reduce the enemy's speed and temporarily weaken their shields and armour.

